Description: Desktop live view, recordings and alerts for Reolink cameras
 Top-bar menu with a live preview of your cameras (GNOME Shell extension,
 tray icon elsewhere), a window with a live grid, SD-card playback,
 spotlight control and snapshots, and desktop notifications on motion,
 person, vehicle or animal detection. Supports several cameras.
